  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組為您的世界新增了「西部大猩猩」這隻生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預設情況下，您可以在叢林或竹林生物群系中找到牠們。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（在 Forge 中，您可以透過編輯 data 資料夾下的 biome tags 與 biome modifier 資料夾中的 json 檔案來更改此項及其他生成設定）<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（或使用資源包）<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（Fabric 版本則提供專屬設定檔）</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">您可以使用任何食物來馴服牠們，但牠們不會跟隨您。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因此這更像是一種友誼關係。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如此一來牠們便不會攻擊您，</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">並且在您靠近時才會保護您免受敵人侵害。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">由於牠們是具有領域性的動物，未馴服的雄性銀背大猩猩有時會互相爭鬥&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">並且當牠們將其他生物或玩家視為威脅時，會主動衝上前並鎖定目標進行攻擊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果您在附近停留不動一段時間，或靠近時按住潛行鍵，牠們便會放過您（除非您已被鎖定為目標）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果地上有物品在牠附近，牠會將其撿起</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">並且若大猩猩未處於戰鬥狀態且生命值受損，牠便會吃下該物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">若在 5 到 10 分鐘內未撿到任何物品，牠的手上便會出現隨機物品。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">隨機物品取自 random_item.json 檔案，可透過編輯物品標籤（item tags）來調整。（若您不想要此功能，只需移除列表中的物品即可）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們有時會坐下休息片刻&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此時每約 10 秒鐘會恢復 1 點生命值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們是群居動物！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">幼崽會跟隨雌性，而雌性則會跟隨雄性銀背大猩猩。</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">生物生成前，系統會檢查該位置周圍是否已有同種生物存在。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">若有，則會統計數量。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">您也可以在設定檔中調整檢查範圍的大小以及最大數量上限。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">若該範圍內的生物數量超過上限，則不會生成新的生物。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此選項旨在防止生物過度生成。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">目前模組支援以下版本：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1&nbsp;| 1.20.1</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">音效提供：sounds dino&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1410/900/javaw_f2ekjmp4x9-ezgif.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>若您需要 CurseForge 上其他版本的模組，請發送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X (Twitter) 上關注我</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs 才能運作</strong></a></span></p>",
